# Placeholder for leak-detector.glb
# In a production environment, this would be a 3D model file in glTF format
# You can create or download a glTF model and place it here

To add a real 3D model:
1. Create or obtain a glTF (.glb) model of your leak detection device
2. Replace this file with the actual .glb file
3. The Digital Twin page will automatically load and display it

Recommended tools:
- Blender (free, open-source 3D modeling)
- Sketchfab (download models)
- glTF Editor tools
